    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397230/extras/645cdc56559e404cbc0799faee5eaf22.poster.avif?t=1697089247\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397230/extras/645cdc56559e404cbc0799faee5eaf22.webm?t=1697089247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397230/extras/645cdc56559e404cbc0799faee5eaf22.mp4?t=1697089247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397230/extras/eedb1d11713f571e0866c38108104679.poster.avif?t=1697089247\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397230/extras/eedb1d11713f571e0866c38108104679.webm?t=1697089247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397230/extras/eedb1d11713f571e0866c38108104679.mp4?t=1697089247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Embark on a nostalgic adventure with Freak Hunter A Retro Type and relive the excitement of old-school platform games. This unique game allows you to become a hunter in a world of zombies and mysterious creatures, whether in single-player or co-op mode.<br><br>Navigate through suspended platforms, discovering a world filled with gold, weapons, and secrets. As the &quot;Freak Hunter,&quot; hone your combat skills to the max, overcome traps, vanquish enemies, and utilize all your abilities to prove yourself. Each action-packed moment will evoke the thrill of being a true platform hero.<br><br>Yet the fun doesn't stop there. Freak Hunter A Retro Type opens the door to your creativity. Design your own levels and shape platforms as you wish. By placing zombies, creatures, and surprises, invite players to take on challenges. Showcase how far you can go in the world you've crafted!<br><br>Freak Hunter A Retro Type doesn't just offer entertainment\u2014it revives nostalgia. With its retro graphics, immersive gameplay, and inventive level design, this game will provide you with unforgettable moments. From single-player adventures to co-op battles, become the fearless hunter in the realm of zombies and creatures!<br><br>Are you prepared to become a true platform hero with Freak Hunter A Retro Type? Step into the world of zombies and mysterious creatures, and revel in thrilling adventures and creative design!<br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br>- Single player combat mode<br>- Co-op combat mode<br>- PvP encounter mode<br>- Episode design mode<br>- Steam achievements<br>- Augmented physics calculation engine<br>- Ability to push, pull, break interactive boxes<br>- Fluent animations that look cute",
